+def _same_wave_why(change: str, partners: list[str], paths: list[str], cause: str) -> str:
+    """Why an accept was refused (#395, :func:`_refused_for_wave`): ``change`` conflicts with
+    ``partners``, accepted in its own wave, in ``paths`` — or, with ``cause``, the check
+    could not run for that reason and ``change`` shares ``paths`` with them."""
